0 Scale Echo - two-motor 2:1 pantograph
0 Name: scale-echo.ldr
0 Author: Designed with ChatGPT for the user
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE CC0-1.0 for original assembly arrangement; see LICENSE.md.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; two medium angular motors, ports A and B.
0 // Motor A rotates the long input arm; B rides on that arm.
0 // Mechanical parallelogram makes output displacement twice input displacement.
0 // Reset pose: u=+X, v=+Z; equal pivot steps 120 LDU.
0 // Bounded demonstration only; avoid a flattened parallelogram.
0 // Coloured markers trace paths in space; no pen or ink mechanism is claimed.
0 // Standard hub battery and flexible motor cables are not separate meshes.
